# Cargo.lock is committed. This is a library crate, but committing the
# lockfile keeps CI (and contributor builds) reproducible — especially
# for the MSRV cell, where transitive bumps to `edition2024` would
# otherwise break the build whenever crates.io ships a new minor.
# Downstream consumers still resolve their own lockfiles; only the
# repository's own builds (CI, examples, benches) are pinned.
/target
/dhat-heap.json

### macOS ###
*.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Files that might appear in the root of a volume
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.fseventsd
.Spotlight-V100
.TemporaryItems
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent

### VisualStudioCode ###
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
